#: scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29cb2a64b3d0f16c312db2a35114f18f9d1733de253cd5d7972d88dbd7d97dd1
#. default-sha256: b3a9b05668c81041f44f0d990bbbd3e46e0a7ec5d650db6a1b13f0ad9611e93c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Come over here, "
"Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Viens ici, "
"Giselle."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afd0724ff2b72fd47443b048eed5a2dd9e33927080b4d1d165cfb8a3062c3b15
#. default-sha256: f38f44f2de85200ef02736e22630f41438202a4b1c60768c2bd75b6c6d15d381
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫O... ⟪k:1⟫Okay... ⟪k:2⟫Um, ⟪k:3⟫may I ask why you asked me here so late at night, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫D... ⟪k:1⟫D’accord... ⟪k:2⟫Euh, ⟪k:3⟫puis-je vous demander pourquoi vous m’avez convoquée si "
"tardivement, Maître ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81ac99da7419d15c26298a7156e89e17fb79653827fdc784152b45391dfa7cb6
#. default-sha256: 86a2351f33d1f8ee430f8a1c0a71b42ab7f4d248b5e555f6d76fd93c48c1f9d6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, I just wanted to have a little chat.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Care for some wine? ⟪k:3⟫Come closer, and "
"I’ll pour you a glass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, je voulais juste te parler un peu.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu veux du vin ? ⟪k:3⟫Approche-toi, je vais "
"te servir un verre."

#: scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 311384df2f4fee718c1f79730924a9f64fc2614eaa0de69aa143c4c482ff20f6
#. default-sha256: 339611ed2671959e913975599098db45db8b30ef47e65581f0f18828dfc0bc12
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had this wine imported from up north.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They use very hard water, and like it "
"rather tart,⟪k:3⟫so it leaves quite the lasting impression on your tongue."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’ai fait venir ce vin du nord.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ils utilisent de l’eau très dure, et ils l’aiment "
"assez aigre,⟪k:3⟫ce qui fait qu’il reste longtemps en bouche."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9be1677a59fd0b891b520496ba44a50b88a1ce98d3909cb73823b44eeaa772cb
#. default-sha256: 66873d43a3b278f5f5e4b391b59e9151030136bea8fa617e2e6b8a5d1d2c86a3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And yet, it goes down so easily, you just can’t seem to stop.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What do you say? Have "
"a sip."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et pourtant, on le boit si facilement qu’on a du mal à s’arrêter.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Qu’en dis-tu ? "
"Goûtes-y."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38bad3cab921361a34d88d5d51035640e4351d0dd41f61add72658c8eba6daca
#. default-sha256: e498e571b94871a2ca3d2714a4cc22ccbbf7825faf6ea67513a2a62ef8198197
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or does your expertise as a trader allow you to evaluate a wine’s quality without tasting it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tu ne vas quand même pas me dire que ton expérience dans le commerce te permet d’évaluer la "
"qualité d’un vin sans l’avoir testé..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0db008cf3dde8f6512dc358cba3462bc887f07b362575b98c9d6b98d73bc17c
#. default-sha256: 47e3919fab1c37c3ea8604e91bf56850a3c06e40e7ec5429cae426a6ee095d1c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫but... ⟪k:3⟫um..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫Non... ⟪k:2⟫mais... ⟪k:3⟫euh..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6867df2f31d7b2e7461d44fdaffe899c59a7d8b90c2df39bc08ea3dddccebf9
#. default-sha256: b50c004bb3a06a34f157e71ecf4eb08f0c7b4d7f2037b1ff27ff8d2665da0336
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, Giselle, don’t trample all over my good graces."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫S’il te plaît, Giselle, n’abuse pas de mes bonnes grâces."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50585ee5651fd4e8fa5e3c56a8446cd684e456cffdd8a2503e63830a4b63e7fe
#. default-sha256: dc792e9777587d264930c68e1924e3b0f5770f9090935f79e150b05be3aa4ea4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Very well then... ⟪k:1⟫I will have a sip, Master, but no more..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Très bien... ⟪k:1⟫Je prendrai une gorgée, Maître, mais pas plus..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c58e1e79631218b4cc7a04f158506313ec0c673abd0dca671f6f30da66848c70
#. default-sha256: d4e730412007928edd667538b25c9b9c4647d64119626ef1b8d0e3a45c265751
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Have you ever considered growing out your hair?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As-tu déjà songé à te laisser pousser les cheveux ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f4c6b12593c6a650b8844b9add5f26d20b29daec62d53cf5e82694d60305acd
#. default-sha256: 915c90fe9f9c817cd4ad4f98dc0ee9001e777f1b4da4e124c90c2042ed1dd1d3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Having long hair made it difficult to do my job..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les cheveux longs rendaient mon métier difficile..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb798e0c2cc79cbe6d15d7c3cc0033c95e343a20186d1ec6b996aafa395b65ef
#. default-sha256: ed3dcf2cfae06286a01a6e0862fe3d637fed1e610155c72036c30767673dd824
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not a merchant anymore, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You deserve to look like the woman you truly "
"are."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais tu n’es plus une marchande.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu mérites de ressembler à la femme que tu es "
"vraiment."

#: scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d7bfd4f93c0701c8635e4a52f388349a8d73f0892be21d84f2d48048d6048fb
#. default-sha256: ddd0201738011495db00ab82676658faf165116db8344f729fca9a331a7f4107
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I have no doubt longer hair would accentuate your natural beauty.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a gorgeous "
"shade of black, so deep a man could get lost in it for years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sans nul doute, des cheveux plus longs accentueraient ta beauté naturelle.⟪k:1⟫ Ils sont "
"d’un noir magnifique, si soutenu qu’un homme pourrait s’y perdre dedans."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8f4e149b33e1e26bbcb9f662ff1e0d7cc92d7ac4e3033cc5a29b21abb63c4b6
#. default-sha256: 4224a93a1cd2aa186b632882b81789813bfe3c5004d158c1dbc6a1352fca26f9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would contrast the color of your skin fabulously.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Highlight your eyes, your "
"cheekbones, your nape, your shoulders, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and your chest..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cela ferait un superbe contraste avec la couleur de ta peau.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ils mettraient en "
"valeur tes yeux, tes joues, ta nuque, tes épaules, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ta poitrine..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2015c7e3783d2c568f8227d6c293961a80f66fc542fc171ebdb07b2677b176d
#. default-sha256: 8ece5a62f814cb832b0a4c1f96908d697e81a393225cecb06a112c1c9905489f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Um, I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I should get going..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Euh, je—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫je devrais y aller..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de80e774075615661e53d86690ed68766c85054f0291b3c6a1fc2233c86b0efa
#. default-sha256: 0c626e893977fe9e789016e14b6738323c5bf8d64e1c14fb6dc87585e6e27d15
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, but we’re not done talking yet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oh, mais nous n’avons pas encore fini de parler."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d32258f33b12077b5fc517983cff043a23810da0bb0e5589415a288248393185
#. default-sha256: 4097c3a8388e94aff59d7ff68c64e4183674c5bc35a725bb4035aed789b81865
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫I would not want a lack of sleep to interfere with my ability to work tomorrow. "
"⟪k:2⟫Thank you very much for the wine. It was delicio—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je... ⟪k:1⟫Je ne voudrais pas qu’un manque de sommeil m’empêche de faire correctement mon "
"travail demain. ⟪k:2⟫Merci beaucoup pour le vin. Il était délici—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5704f3552f9cc95cf9fa7203bd8ed9dc71ffc319b2942b7b9d7118e5a26d8590
#. default-sha256: d0a3352b4c1ac39e944cbba3bae8b7b50614717262b6f3b58eab5a99816b7be0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫—?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫—?!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08c7f458df87cdad075e5cf48b6a6691a052ff613e719c813d41d0e0ff530e1d
#. default-sha256: b83bad82dc43d6e963780b30b4f20b60ae0a5196a55646b6a4ddf6163bc0c0d1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so cold-hearted, now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From the moment I first laid eyes on you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pas besoin d’être aussi froide, voyons.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dès que j’ai posé les yeux sur toi..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32120506c1349b4597cd166d4fa19a7f2261a9e0e9d40d63c89013bde35c6c96
#. default-sha256: 9d43df086d147741b1279c3b01f62b4d932aa11cdc30a3401eab8da79d82637b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫M— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That’s enough fooling around for one night!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫M—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maître !⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Je-⟪k:5⟫Je me suis suffisamment amusée pour cette nuit !"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5b5ad719fffb2cc3dbd671edf2ced62cc173f92270b3627c774c10465735fa7
#. default-sha256: 35fe6b65fe93264c2c0588f2081274e3ea1d0c6ac4227318868cbc71917ebfa9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, now, don’t be afraid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wouldn’t do anything to hurt you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I simply "
"want to express my love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Allons, allons, n’aie pas peur.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je ne te ferai jamais de mal.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Je veux "
"simplement exprimer mon amour."

#: scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4ca492289db6657bb79e5f427e3e7f64ab7c67bf4539baad6265a7df8d61c9d
#. default-sha256: 3be053e224d0a51e6b4fcc2d3bd5a52d4a5ffd0b4ed762664765ee446c084e6f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫L— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Let go of me!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I-I only came here to work, nothing more!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫L—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lâchez-moi !⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Je-Je suis venue ici pour le travail, rien de plus !"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12694ecf4d51f57088def831061f2040acdb93ea04c3e2790be86e5da1c5943e
#. default-sha256: 1958bc1babfa5edd58f95dac3a09b57c3ec7d2d5cfdb3f78ffe3213fa07c5b99
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The first time I saw you, I thought it would be a tragic waste to leave you to wither away "
"working at some little street-side shop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La première fois que je t’ai vue, je me suis dit que ce serait tellement dommage de te "
"laisser dépérir à travailler dans une petite échoppe de seconde zone."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F3005EFA_444A_4354_A225_921F01A37502
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6c9505ed09d993e7c5c7a650632eeac6de2d3a88a52022b31236b7689a337e0
#. default-sha256: 36bb71e6ba51a6e30c2b29a755a03d98eef4ddb12e36c7cad675a077c10ce4bb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F3005EFA_444A_4354_A225_921F01A37502"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Stop—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Arrêtez—!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_46E28852_C5E3_4052_B683_A1257437AB7D
