#: scenario5:scenario5_7CAECF07_8336_4ED7_B3F0_227FF0ADDFB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19075200c7da5921dd9323431f8dac0c855034a67e7784b29826051ca5801888
