msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EB611ACB_B35D_4124_8B3B_C13FE06A9AA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her skin dry, her eyes sunken, her hair faded and stripped of its luster, her head down, her "
"cracked lips barely moving as she spoke."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle avait la peau sèche, les yeux enfoncés, les cheveux fanés et ternis, la tête baissée, "
"et ses lèvres craquelées bougeaient à peine quand elle parlait."

#: scenario5:scenario5_126DFA18_91A2_4506_8DF7_0D01694C541B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b288ee367b28545f5375254216e8fbab1de627fc127768b6951be39216a1486
